			"description": "Assault Cannon Ammunition Hopper (200)",
			"local_notes": "One full hopper load per the assault cannon's shots rating.\n\nLore: Fed from a drum or backpack hopper rather than a magazine, matching depictions of sustained rotary fire.\n\nDesign: Generic ammunition line; not separately anchored.",
